  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  edit: 0
  note: "Coward Brain:\r\n\r\nThis type of character is scared of any target. \r\nOnce
    it sees the target, it will immediately run away to create distance. \r\nWhen
    the target is no longer visible, the character will return to its normal state.\r\n\r\nIdeal
    for frightened NPCs, animals, or characters that should avoid confrontation entirely."
